#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:45
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_ContestHall_Text_WhichContestYouEntering"
msgid ""
"Which CONTEST are you entering?\n"
"Want a piece of advice?\p"
"In any CONTEST, for example, a CUTE\n"
"CONTEST, I don't think they judge you\l"
"only on cuteness in the first round.\p"
"You need to work out ways for raising\n"
"POKéMON better.$"
msgstr ""
"你要参加哪种华丽大赛？\n"
"要不要听我一句建议？\p"
"不管是哪种华丽大赛，比如说\n"
"可爱华丽大赛，我觉得第一轮\l"
"评审的并不只是可爱程度。\p"
"你得想办法\n"
"把宝可梦培养得更好。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:55
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_ContestHall_Text_RaisedMonToBeCute"
msgid ""
"I raised my POKéMON to be cute.\p"
"I found out you can put POKéMON in\n"
"a CONTEST for cuteness!\p"
"I'm so glad I raised my POKéMON with\n"
"loving care…$"
msgstr ""
"我把我的宝可梦培养得很可爱。\p"
"我发现可以让宝可梦\n"
"参加比可爱的华丽大赛！\p"
"真庆幸我一直用心地\n"
"照顾我的宝可梦……$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_ContestHall_Text_MyMonRules"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON rules!\p"
"It's cool, tough yet beautiful, cute,\n"
"and smart. It's complete!\p"
"I may as well go for wins in every\n"
"single CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦是最棒的！\p"
"它又帅气，又强壮，又美丽，\n"
"又可爱，又聪明。完美无缺！\p"
"干脆每一种华丽大赛\n"
"都去拿冠军好了。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_ContestHall_Text_NormalRankStage"
msgid ""
"POKéMON CONTESTS\n"
"NORMAL RANK STAGE!$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦华丽大赛\n"
"普通级舞台！$"
